        "label": "How Reevo turns sales context into action",
        "headline": "The AI-Native Sales Platform.",
        "lede": "Every call, email, and deal feeds one shared memory, so Reevo drafts follow-ups, updates the CRM, and flags risk on its own. Works alongside the tools you already use, or runs everything out of the box.",
